<%# The options behind the three pickers on this page, in one copy by id, for
    the same reason sites/_known_values_payload gives: the controller reads a
    payload named by DOM id rather than one rendered per field.

    json_escape for the same reason too — these are strings the customer typed
    and strings a browser sent us, going inside a <script> element, and a
    literal "</script>" in one of them would end the element early and spill the
    rest into the document as markup. -%>
<%= tag.script json_escape(campaign_values.payload.to_json).html_safe,
               type: "application/json",
               id: "campaign-values",
               nonce: content_security_policy_nonce %>
